pseudocode:
per tick (whole-function loop):
  if (b[r15+0x10] == 0) skip emission
  copy state+0x1d4 -> candidate(sp+1080, 28 bytes) when the change detector reports a difference
  if (b[r8+0x1d6]) { byte = arm(0, candidate[+0x0c]); candidate[+0x0c] = byte; set/clear mask bit 0x100 by (byte != 0) }
  if (b[r8+0x1db]) { byte = arm(1, candidate[+0x0d]); candidate[+0x0d] = byte; set/clear mask bit 0x200 by (byte != 0) }
  ... toggle block: r0 = [r15+0x1d0] & candidate_mask; if empty skip
  if (memcmp(candidate, last_sent@0x4ecc, 14) != 0) { copy 28 bytes to 0x4ecc; counter = 100; build 14-byte or 28-byte frame; emit }
  arm(index, value): per-channel hysteresis state machine at base+index, base = candidate+0x0a
